      "title": "Video: image to video on Wan 2.2 14B",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Video: image to video on Wan 2.2 14B\n\nMakes a clip of 2 to 5 seconds at 480p that starts from your image with Wan 2.2 I2V A14B. It makes no sound. Built from Comfy's template video_wan2_2_14B_i2v.\n\n## Models\n\n- [umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors): umt5-xxl text encoder, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/google/umt5-xxl).\n- [wan_2.1_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors): Wan 2.1 VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged).\n- [wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors): Wan 2.2 I2V A14B, high noise, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.2-I2V-A14B).\n- [wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors): Wan 2.2 I2V A14B, low noise, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.2-I2V-A14B).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
